        {
          "t": 227.8,
          "file": "frames/f048_00227.80s.jpg",
          "why": "drift 0.15"
        }
      ],
      "transcript": "But if we just think about representation a little more cleverly, we can do exactly what computers do, using not what mathematicians call base 1, where the finger's either there or it's not, but base 2."
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "start": 234.4,
      "end": 242.2,
