      "activity": 1.11,
      "keyframes": [
        {
          "t": 234.8,
          "same_as": "frames/f035_00145.60s.jpg"
        }
      ],
      "transcript": "And in base 2, we just need two digits at our disposal. And we could call these digits 1 and 2, A and B, black or white."
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "start": 242.2,
      "end": 255.2,
      "start_ts": "04:02.2",
      "end_ts": "04:15.2",
      "reasons": [
