          "file": "frames/f054_00281.00s.jpg",
          "why": "drift 0.14"
        }
      ],
      "transcript": "And what if you have electricity or not, well, there's your sort of two possible values, either it's there or it's not. And because computers are electrical devices,"
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "start": 281.8,
      "end": 289.0,
