          "file": "frames/f056_00288.20s.jpg",
          "why": "drift 0.12"
        }
      ],
      "transcript": "this is why binary is just useful. It's nice and simple. Either electricity is there or it's not. So when you plug this device in and you've got all these electrons"
    },
