          "file": "frames/f057_00290.80s.jpg",
          "why": "anchor"
        }
      ],
      "transcript": "or whatever flowing, maybe if we just kind of hang on to some of that electricity, we can represent what we'll call a 1. And maybe if we let it dissipate or go away, that's a 0. So on and off maps very readily to this idea of just 0s and 1s."
    },
